{"strongs": "H2397", "word": "חַח", "translit": "chach", "root": "חוח", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "hook, ring, fetter", "definition": "חַח noun masculine hook, ring, fetter ; — חַח absolute Exod 35:22 suffix חַחִי Isa 37:29 ; 2Kgs 19:28 plural חַחִים Ezek 19:4 + 2 t. + Ezek 29:4 Qr ( Kt erroneous חחיים , see below); — 1. hook, ring , in nose of captive וְשַׂמְתִּי חַחִי בְּאַפֶּ֑ךָ Isa 37:29 = 2Kgs 19:28 (compare בַּחֹחִים 2Chr 33:11 , see חוֺחַ above); so of princes of Judah, under figure of young lions Ezek 19:4 ; Ezek 19:9 (in v Ezek 19:9 transp:, so that בחחים following הביא as v Ezek 19:4 so Co ); in jaws of crocodile (metaphor of Pharaoh), with נתן Ezek 29:4 , compare Ezek 38:4 (but ᵐ5 omits and sense opposes, compare Co and — dubious — Da ). 2. hook, ring as ornament, perhaps nose-ring (others brooch , see VB ), Exod 35:22 ( P ; || נֶזֶם , טַבַּעַת , כּוּמָז ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2604')\">BDB2604</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2397')\">H2397</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2603')\">BDB2603</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2605')\">BDB2605</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חַח</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>hook, ring, fetter</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>חַח</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Exod 35:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,22)\">Exod 35:22</ref> suffix <bdbheb>חַחִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 37:29\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(23,37,29)\">Isa 37:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 19:28\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(12,19,28)\">2Kgs 19:28</ref> plural <bdbheb>חַחִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 19:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,19,4)\">Ezek 19:4</ref> + 2 t. + <ref ref=\"Ezek 29:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,29,4)\