 — <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Da')\">Da</lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>hook, ring</highlight> as ornament, perhaps <highlight>nose-ring</highlight> (others <highlight>brooch</highlight>, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('VB')\"><reflink>VB</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Exod 35:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,22)\">Exod 35:22</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; || <bdbheb>נֶזֶם</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>טַבַּעַת</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>כּוּמָז</bdbheb>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 35:22", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 35, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Isa 37:29", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 37, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "2Kgs 19:28", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 19, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Ezek 19:4", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 19, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Ezek 29:4", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 29, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "2Chr 33:11", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 33, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ezek 19:9", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 19, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ezek 38:4", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 38, "verse": 4}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["חַח", "חַחִי", "חַחִים", "חחיים", "וְשַׂמְתִּי חַחִי", "בְּאַפֶּ֑ךָ", "בַּחֹחִים", "חוֺחַ", "בחחים", "הביא", "נתן", "ᵐ5", "נֶזֶם", "טַבַּעַת", "כּוּמָז"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Co", "Da", "Kt", "P", "Qr", "Sept", "VB"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB2604", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}